\description{
Aligns the contrast results of several methods, e.g. facades of \code{\link[=build_contrast_analysis]{build_contrast_analysis()}} or \link{ContrastsTable}s
holding another tool's results, on the subject (e.g. protein) and the contrast, and reports which pairs each method
estimates and where their inferences contradict each other. The columns of each result are read through its
\link{ContrastConfiguration}, so tables with other column names can be compared too.

The status of a pair in a method is \verb{not estimated} (no row or no effect), \verb{not tested} (an effect but no FDR),
\verb{not significant}, or \code{up} / \code{down} (FDR below \code{fdr_threshold}, by the sign of the effect).
}
